WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Broddie Stalwart: Well, we're victorious again!

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.300
Broddie Stalwart: Just as before, the Urun were no match for the bravery of the Gibberlings!

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:15.000
Broddie Stalwart: Kharyskhan is defeated, and his followers will once again hide in the deepest cracks. It will be a while before they'll crawl out into the light again...

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.900
Broddie Stalwart: A new age of Isa begins, and we will reconnect with our lost brothers and sisters!

5
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.800
Broddie Stalwart: So let us raise our cups to that!

6
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.960
Gibberlings: Bottoms up!

7
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.940
Gibberlings: Gib-gib-gibberlings!
